type: software
title: "Imaris XTension Suite — Cochlear Implant Analysis"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-03-30
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.19324059
url: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19324059
repository-code: https://github.com/EllieCho/Imaris-XTension-Cochlear-Analysis
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >
  Custom MATLAB XTension modules for Imaris 10.2, developed for
  three-dimensional analysis of cochlear implant tissue response and
  auditory neuron distribution from light-sheet fluorescence microscopy
  data. The suite includes four scripts: SpotsToCylinders.m for electrode
  reconstruction, SpotsVoronoiCreate.m for 3D Voronoi tessellation,
  SpotsResizeDiameter.m for spatial proximity masking, and
  CreateSurfacesFromLabeledMap.m for surface generation from labeled
  channels.
